  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "strike the highest-energy enemy, dealing damage and reducing their energy",
    "skill1": "dash to closest symmetrical enemy at battle start, dealing damage",
    "skill2": "normal attacks replaced by rapid strikes briefly at battle start",
    "skill3": "battle crit increase",
    "skill4": "gain a shield at battle start",
    "skill5": "rapid attack hits also reduce target vitality"
  },
  "play_overview": "Silvina opens by **dashing to the closest symmetrical enemy**, landing burst damage before normal pacing resumes. At battle start she swaps to **rapid strikes** briefly and gains a shield for early survivability. Her ultimate strikes the **highest-energy enemy**, dealing damage and **draining their energy** to disrupt casters before they can fire. Battle crit growth adds finishing pressure, and rapid hits **reduce target vitality** for softer kills. She excels as an **opening assassin** who punishes backline energy hoarders and symmetrical formations. She falters when symmetrical targets are absent, when burst windows end before she reaches priority foes, or when enemies deny her opening dash entirely.",
  "counter_overview": "Silvina **opens by flashing** to a symmetrical foe, then her ultimate strikes the **highest-Energy** enemy to **drain their cast**. Protect Energy-heavy carries and avoid an easy symmetrical dive mark on the opening beat. **Delete her early** with high-damage melee like [[Himmel]] or [[Shakir]] before the drain lands, **cancel the ultimate** with [[Lily May]], and peel the threatened caster with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]] or [[Evie]]."
